sequenceDiagram
    participant Cliente as Cliente Web
    participant ChatApi as ChatApiController
    participant ChatSvc as TelegramChatService
    participant ChatbotApi as ConsertaPraMim.API /api/telegram-chatbot/*
    participant Orch as TelegramChatbotOrchestrator
    participant AiGateway as OpenAiTelegramGateway
    participant OpenAI as OpenAI Responses API
    participant Hub as TelegramChatHub

    Cliente->>ChatApi: POST /api/chats/{chatId}/messages
    ChatApi->>ChatApi: valida sessao e ownership
    ChatApi->>ChatSvc: SendFromClientAsync
    ChatSvc-->>ChatApi: mensagem cliente persistida
    ChatApi->>ChatbotApi: POST /messages (incoming)

    ChatApi->>Orch: GenerateAssistantReplyAsync
    Orch->>ChatbotApi: POST /session
    ChatbotApi-->>Orch: conversationId
    Orch->>ChatbotApi: GET /conversations/{id}/history
    ChatbotApi-->>Orch: historico mensagens snapshots actions

    alt resposta em cache valida
        Orch-->>ChatApi: reply UsedCache true
    else sem cache
        Orch->>Orch: monta prompt (politicas + contexto truncado)
        Orch->>AiGateway: GenerateReplyAsync
        AiGateway->>OpenAI: POST /v1/responses
        alt sucesso
            OpenAI-->>AiGateway: output_text + usage tokens
            AiGateway-->>Orch: sucesso
            Orch->>Orch: parse estruturado intent/entities/nextStep
        else erro ou timeout
            OpenAI-->>AiGateway: falha
            AiGateway-->>Orch: erro controlado
            Orch->>Orch: gera fallback seguro
        end

        Orch->>ChatbotApi: POST /context-snapshots
        Orch->>ChatbotApi: POST /actions
        Orch->>ChatbotApi: PATCH /conversations/{id}/state
        Orch-->>ChatApi: reply final
    end

    ChatApi->>ChatSvc: AppendAssistantReplyAsync
    ChatSvc-->>ChatApi: mensagem do assistente
    ChatApi->>ChatbotApi: POST /messages (outgoing assistant)
    ChatApi->>Hub: BroadcastConversationMessage
    Hub-->>Cliente: ReceiveConversationMessage em tempo real

    Note over Orch,OpenAI: ST-006 aplica fallback, cache, limites de contexto/tokens e metricas de custo/latencia.
